1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Bare porcelain, waiting for blue.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:10,600
Cobalt goes on first, under the glaze.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,200
One river, painted round the jar.

4
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,200
Step into the painting.

5
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:34,600
Grey, until the fire.

6
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:39,400
The blue only arrives in the fire.

7
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,300
By the early 14th century, Jingdezhen mass-produced it.

8
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:54,000
The Blue Only Arrives in the Fire
